# Copy this file to ".env" and fill in your real key. Never commit ".env".
#
# Get a free key at https://www.weatherapi.com/ (free tier is fine).
#
# This app uses WeatherAPI.com, so the variable is named accordingly.
# (The original brief said OPENWEATHER_API_KEY; if you truly need that name,
#  rename it here AND in netlify/functions/weather.js — search for WEATHERAPI_KEY.)
WEATHERAPI_KEY=your_weatherapi_key_here
